            <div style="font-size: 2.2rem; font-weight: 800; color: rgba(255, 87, 34, 0.4); line-height: 1; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">03</div>
            <h3 style="color: #fff; font-size: 1.2rem; margin-bottom: 0.6rem;">Technology & Cable Selection</h3>
